    "gm_notes": "<p>While not usually threatening to an adult, small animals and children can be in great danger when bitten by a venomous snake. If encountered in numbers, these verdant serpents can threaten even the hardiest of folk. This beast was built by selecting a CR 1/2 Serpentine and the Venomous ability, to make its bite more dangerous.</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
